#: data/org.gnome.Screenshot.metainfo.xml.in:11
msgid ""
"Screenshot is a simple utility that lets you take pictures of your computer "
"screen. Screenshots can be of your whole screen, any specific application, "
"or a selected rectangular area. You can also copy the captured screenshot "
"directly into the GNOME clipboard and paste it into other applications."
msgstr ""
"Screenshot is 'n eenvoudige hulpmiddel waarmee jy prente van jou "
"rekenaarskerm kan neem. Skermkiekies kan van jou hele skerm wees, enige "
"spesifieke aansoek, of 'n geselekteerde reghoekige area. Jy kan ook die "
"vasgelegde skermskoot direk na die GNOME-knipbord kopieer en dit in ander "
"toepassings plak."

#: data/org.gnome.Screenshot.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid ""
"Screenshot allows you to take screenshots even when it’s not open: just "
"press the PrtSc button on your keyboard, and a snapshot of your whole screen "
"will be saved to your Pictures folder. Hold Alt while pressing PrtSc and you "
"will get a screenshot of only the currently selected window."
msgstr ""
"Screenshot toelaat jou om skermkiekies te neem selfs wanneer dit nie oop is "
"nie: druk net die PrtSc knoppie op jou sleutelbord, en 'n momentopname van "
"jou hele skerm sal in jou Prente vouer gestoor word. Hou Alt terwyl jy PrtSc "
"druk en jy sal 'n skermskoot kry van slegs die tans geselekteerde venster."

